(7396496, 1162962, 68504, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by paulwestmoreland1:</b></div><hr/><i> It''s beautiful, and how you have the faces barely visible. The contrast, focus, leaves, the window panes and separation between things. There is a lot of mystery and a certain "come home please" in this. Sort of like, "you''re not here right now, so this is all we will let you see; but there''s more, just come home" - thx for sharing </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I agree.</td>', 'Originally posted by paulwestmoreland1: It''s beautiful, and how you have the faces barely visible. The contrast, focus, leaves, the window panes and separation between things. There is a lot of mystery and a certain "come home please" in this. Sort of like, "you''re not here right now, so this is all we will let you see; but there''s more, just come home" - thx for sharing   I agree.', '2015-08-11 01:50:04.000000', NULL, 0),
